{
	"_doc": "Map skins: one per continent, three sections. territory = Territory Board (BoardView): frame_bg/frame (board plate), center_bg/center_border (centre plate), title/title_dim (continent name and rule), tile/tile_alt (territory tiles, alternating by index), tint+tint_amt (tint of the non-territory tiles), radius (tile corner radius in tile sizes), pattern + motif/motif_a (small procedural motif on territory tiles), emblem/emblem_a (big continent emblem watermark in the centre). battle = Battle Board (BattleGridView): frame_bg/frame, mine_light/mine_dark (your half), foe_light/foe_dark (enemy half), radius, line (deploy line), highland/highland_rim, wall/wall_rim, pattern/motif/motif_a, emblem/emblem_a. backdrop = top / bottom colours of the screen's radial background. pattern is one of MapSkin.PATTERNS. Colours are hex strings (RRGGBB). Missing keys fall back to the original look (MapSkin.DEFAULT_*).",
